# Per-developer overrides. Copy to `.env.local`, which is gitignored — never
# commit real values, and never point a build you intend to ship at anything
# but production.
#
# Only REACT_APP_* names are exposed to the app (CRA), and they are inlined at
# BUILD time, so the dev server has to be restarted after changing them.

# Point the app at a local Supabase stack instead of production. Unset in any
# normal build: src/data/supabase.ts falls back to the production project.
# See scripts/clone-prod-local.sh, which copies prod's schema into that stack.
#
# REACT_APP_SUPABASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:54321
# REACT_APP_SUPABASE_KEY=<the ANON_KEY printed by `npx supabase status`>
